From 786fcaf53ff2edb02e94af1fc1fa27f5dce2e7f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
by: triplecN
Subject: [PATCH 02/20] chain parameters and genesis

CacheCoin mainnet and regtest parameters (60 s spacing, halving every
1,051,200 blocks, message start, ports, address prefixes) and the mined
genesis block. -testnet, -testnet4 and -signet are refused.
---
